s follows:\n\n- First, we compute ${u}_{1}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{{\\sigma }_{1}}A{v}_{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Then, we compute ${u}_{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{{\\sigma }_{2}}A{v}_{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we construct the matrices $U,$ $Σ,$ and $V:$\n\n$$\nU=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} & -\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{aligned}],\\,Σ=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}],\\,V=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186172022 1038 #edb/ref 17592186382970 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186175964 1038 #edb/ref 17592186382901 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186175964 1038 #edb/ref 17592186382921 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186175964 1038 #edb/ref 17592186382928 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186176000 1038 #edb/ref 17592186382956 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186176003 1038 #edb/ref 17592186382949 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186176048 1038 #edb/ref 17592186383486 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186176048 1038 #edb/ref 17592186383493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186176245 1068 #edb/ref 17592186173698 13194139533455 17592186045585 false] [17592186176245 1068 #edb/ref 17592186382908 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186176245 1070 #edb/