8 #edb/ref 17592186382854 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382853 1069 "q-105698" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382853 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382853 1071 "Consider the vector field $F=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,i+y{z}^{2}\\,j+(x-z)\\,k.$ Evaluate $∇\\times F$ at the point  $(2,-1,3).$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382853 1072 #uuid "27a8e275-9fb8-5aa1-b8f3-46200f4c3126" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382853 1074 "If $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j+R\\,k$ is a vector field on ${R}^{3}$ and the partial derivatives of the components of $F$ all exist, then the curl of $F$ is the vector field given by\n\n$$\ncurl\\,F=∇\\times F=|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂x} & \\frac{∂}{∂y} & \\frac{∂}{∂z} \\\\ P & Q & R\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{curl}\\,F & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂x} & \\frac{∂}{∂y} & \\frac{∂}{∂z} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y) & y{z}^{2} & (x-z)\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =[\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x-z)-\\frac{∂}{∂z}(y{z}^{2})]i-[\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x-z)-\\frac{∂}{∂z}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y))]j+[\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y{z}^{2})-\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y))]k \\\\  & =(0-2yz)i-(1-0)j+(0-\\frac{1}{x+y})k \\\\  & =-2yz\\,i-j-\\frac{1}{x+y}\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate $\\text{curl}\\,F$ at the point $(2,-1,3),$ and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\text{curl}\\,F)(2,-1,3) & =-2(-1)(3)\\,i-j-\\frac{1}{2+(-1)}\\,k \\\\  & =6\\,i-j-k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382854 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382855 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382854 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382856 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382854 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382857 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382854 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382858 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382854 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382859 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382854 1076 