2186045585 true] [17592186382873 1074 "First, let's find $\\text{E}[X].$ \n\nThe expected value of a discrete random variable $X$ with probability mass function $f(x)$ and sample space $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}x\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in S}x\\cdot f(x) \\\\  & =0\\cdot 0.74+1\\cdot 0.07+2\\cdot 0.08+3\\cdot 0.09+4\\cdot 0.02 \\\\  & =0.58.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[0.5X] & =0.5\\text{E}[X] \\\\  & =0.5\\cdot 0.58 \\\\  & =0.29.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382875 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382876 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382877 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382878 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186382879 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1079 #edb/ref 17592186382875 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382874 1080 #uuid "21aa6194-1e9a-587c-87dd-164f7e74fe0f" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382875 1081 "0.29" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382875 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382875 1084 #uuid "aa778e12-6b95-5270-9997-d6983013952e" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382876 1081 "0.22" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382876 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382876 1084 #uuid "f368aa5b-a370-599b-ab07-77e277412b30" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382877 1081 "0.24" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186382