rac{yz}{{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}+1}\\,i+\\frac{xz}{{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}+1}\\,j+\\frac{xy}{{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}+1}\\,k" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383003 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383003 1084 #uuid "b14f2ad2-72a2-5e49-bfaf-d442c2b9f197" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383004 1081 "\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}+1}\\,i+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}+1}\\,j+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}+1}\\,k" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383004 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383004 1084 #uuid "026ff4bf-c0ad-56d4-bab2-b4e07f1395b6" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383005 1068 #edb/ref 17592186383006 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383005 1069 "q-122617" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383005 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383005 1071 "Find the gradient vector field of the function $f(x,y,z)=z{x}^{2}+x{y}^{3}-y{z}^{4}.$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383005 1072 #uuid "d9bc952c-6483-5cda-bd93-71113b0eb352" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383005 1074 "The gradient vector field of a function $f$ is given by $∇f.$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(z{x}^{2}+x{y}^{3}-y{z}^{4}) \\\\  & =2xz+{y}^{3} \\\\ {f}_{y}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(z{x}^{2}+x{y}^{3}-y{z}^{4}) \\\\  & =3x{y}^{2}-{z}^{4} \\\\ {f}_{z}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(z{x}^{2}+x{y}^{3}-y{z}^{4}) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-4y{z}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the gradient vector field of $f(x,y,z)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =(2xz+{y}^{3})\\,i+(3x{y}^{2}-{z}^{4})\\,j+({x}^{2}-4y{z}^{3})\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383006 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383007 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383006 1075 #edb/ref 17