"images/46/4663eaaf8c31781ebffe486d2f5a4e4036173114d13cf1a77b8a8f8d67603a29.png" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383037 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383037 1084 #uuid "21421b38-5138-523b-9081-5643dff4c2f5" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383038 1081 "images/23/23fa66fe343603112a28c4c97db76a4a58c56468b756654af0c426ea031e1065.png" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383038 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383038 1084 #uuid "221f995d-6011-5cf9-9cb1-b16eb83bc1a5" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383039 1081 "images/dc/dcd7de7b52c59ceda71245ef18d7cb1327a0e3f3b93f6f8e0bb8c5e386958217.png" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383039 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383039 1084 #uuid "03dafc83-b8c9-596e-ade6-d66b6c98a145" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383040 1068 #edb/ref 17592186383041 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383040 1069 "q-123175" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383040 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383040 1071 "Consider the vector field $F=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,i+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-y)\\,j.$ \nEvaluate $∇\\cdot F$ at the point $(0,-1).$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383040 1072 #uuid "1ef0a7a3-f12b-51cf-8356-485327cebc47" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383040 1074 "If $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$ is a vector field on ${R}^{2}$ and the partial derivatives  of the components of $F$ all exist, then the divergence of $F$ is the scalar field given by\n\n$$\n\\text{div}\\,F=∇\\cdot F=\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\cdot F & =\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y))+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{x+y}+\\frac{(-1)}{x-y} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2y}{{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate $\\text{div}\\,F$ at the point $(0,-1),$ and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(∇\\cdot F)(0,-1) & =-\\frac{2(-1)}{{0}^{2}-(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{(-2)}{(-1)} \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383042 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383043 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383044 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383045 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383046 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383046 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383041 1080 #uuid "a90f1f2e-6bea-5afb-916e-20d455797ede" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383042 1081 "2" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383042 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383042 1084 #uuid "a2a14eda-ccab-5f7f-a719-20929206c183" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383043 1081 "1" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383043 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383043 1084 #uuid "7f5fbc0f-62fd-51ae-9453-284b6e551213" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383044 1081 "0" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383044 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383044 1084 #uuid "a64f1af0-be8c-5a44-a9cc-2fba5bb44234" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383045 1081 "-1" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383045 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383045 1084 #uuid "78cbd39b-453a-54ac-94ad-3b0b9c0fae93" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383046 1081 "-2" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383046 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383046 1084 #uuid "2a33efaf-3611-56e4-a949-ec2d696d451d" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383047 1068 #edb/ref 17592186383048 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383047 1069 "q-123192" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383047 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383047 1071 "Consider the vector field $F={x}^{2}yz\\,i+x{y}^{2}z\\,j+xy{z}^{2}\\,k.$ \nEvaluate $∇\\cdot F$ at the point $(1,2,2).$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383047 1072 #uuid "9c8a3eea-616a-5c49-bb08-64624b7ee7d9" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383047 1074 "If $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j+R\\,k$ is a vector field on ${R}^{3}$ and the partial derivatives of the components of $F$ all exist, then the divergence of $F$ is the scalar field given by\n\n$$\n\\text{div}\\,F=∇\\cdot F=\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}+\\frac{∂R}{∂z}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\cdot F & =\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}+\\frac{∂R}{∂z} \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}yz)+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x{y}^{2}z)+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(xy{z}^{2}) \\\\  & =2xyz+2xyz+2xyz \\\\  & =6xyz.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate $\\text{div}\\,F$ at the point $(1,2,2),$ and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(∇\\cdot F)(1,2,2) & =6(1)(2)(2) \\\\  & =6\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =24.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383048 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383049 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383048 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383050 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383048 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383051 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383048 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383052 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383048 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383053 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383048 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383048 1077 "selection