 17592186045585 true] [17592186383088 1084 #uuid "4063a276-ab18-5a28-835e-27da301a0497" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383089 1068 #edb/ref 17592186383090 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383089 1069 "q-127650" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383089 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383089 1071 "If $h(x,y)=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x}),$ find $∇h(x,y).$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383089 1072 #uuid "a0611e4b-e342-5f93-a418-5af6bc5c2cae" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383089 1074 "First, we find the partial derivatives: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+{(\\frac{y}{x})}^{2}}\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\ {f}_{y}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+{(\\frac{y}{x})}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the gradient is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & ={f}_{x}(x,y)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y)\\,j \\\\  & =-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383091 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383092 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383093 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383094 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383095 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383094 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383090 1080 #uuid "ac0e2a52-799a-5e23-b506-14c0bcd60b6e" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383091 1081 "-\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,j" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383091 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383091 1084 #uuid "1db9d9fc-22a0-597f-aae9-81bb345368b7" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383092 1081 "\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,i-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,j" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383092 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383092 1084 #uuid "8ecab5b2-5c74-57ec-9424-e1622a043b35" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383093 1081 "-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,j" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383093 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383093 1084 #uuid "59d1274a-8060-550f-9c16-15badbd51936" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383094 1081 "-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,j" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383094 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383094 1084 #uuid "89408273-38c8-5f7c-aaa3-d98a11b3ce1e" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383095 1081 "\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,i-\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,j" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383095 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383095 1084 #uuid "e06e7ee3-6e0b-56c9-a951-2e2c02187b31" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383096 1068 #edb/ref 17592186383097 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383096 1069 "q-127945" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383096 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383096 1071 "If $f(x,y,z)={x}^{y}+{y}^{z},$ find $∇f(x,y,z).$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383096 1072 #uuid "cf052c6a-faee-5b8c-b178-4c397426507c" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383096 1074 "First, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{y}+{y}^{z}) \\\\  & =y{x}^{y-1} \\\\ {f}_{y}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{y}+{y}^{z}) \\\\  & ={x}^{y}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+z{y}^{z-1} \\\\ {f}_{z}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}({x}^{y}+{y}^{z}) \\\\  & ={y}^{z}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the gradient is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =y{x}^{y-1}\\,i+({x}^{y}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+z{y}^{z-1})j+{y}^{z}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383098 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383099 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383100 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383101 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383102 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383098 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383097 1080 #uuid "aa7309b8-5993-5bb2-9ecd-ce38b1c0b74d" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383098 1081 "y{x}^{y-1}\\,i+({x}^{y}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+z{y}^{z-1})j+{y}^{z}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y\\,k" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383098 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383098 1084 #uuid "514f6510-65a6-5c71-8eca-34568a35dcba" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383099 1081 "y{x}^{y-1}\\,i+z{y}^{z-1}\\,j+{y}^{z}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y\\,k" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383099 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 175921860