y)=(-2,-1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & ={f}_{x}(x,y)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y)\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{x+y}{x-y})\\,i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{x+y}{x-y})\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{1(x-y)-(x+y)(1)}{(x-y)^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{1(x-y)-(x+y)(-1)}{(x-y)^{2}}\\,j \\\\  & =-\\frac{2y}{(x-y)^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{2x}{(x-y)^{2}}\\,j \\\\ ∇f(-2,-1) & =-\\frac{2(-1)}{(-2-(-1))^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{2(-2)}{(-2-(-1))^{2}}\\,j \\\\  & =2\\,i-4\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we normalize $∇f(-2,-1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∇f(-2,-1)}{‖∇f(-2,-1)‖} & =\\frac{2\\,i-4\\,j}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-4)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{5}}(2\\,i-4\\,j) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}(i-2\\,j) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}(\\,i-2\\,j)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383161 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383162 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383163 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383164 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383165 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383162 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383160 1080 #uuid "876e06ec-0ab3-5cfb-b188-15f5d0a5be15" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383161 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{10}(4\\,i+2\\,j)" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383161 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383161 1084 #uuid "1239f96f-2e4e-508d-a9f2-75796efa86a0" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383162 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}(\\,i-2\\,j)" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383162 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383162 1084 #uuid "45a77767-f45c-5c88-af82-5221a5fbd33b" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383163 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}(2\\,j-j)" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383163 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383163 1084 #uuid "33650346-32bd-534a-a64c-45e97e73fd4f" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383164 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}(\\,i-\\,j)" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383164 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383164 1084 #uuid "64e6389b-f8ce-50bf-a097-05a8b301d96c" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383165 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{10}(2\\,i+4\\,j)" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383165 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383165 1084 #uuid "d73cf648-7973-5ea5-aece-b31b3cb3d9d0" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383166 1068 #edb/ref 17592186383167 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383166 1069 "q-130274" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383166 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383166 1071 "Find a unit normal vector to the level curve of the function $f(x,y)=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})$ that passes through the point where $(x,y)=(2,-2).$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383166 1072 #uuid "d9318eb5-4446-512c-876e-9868eec1bc8a" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383166 1074 "A normal vector to the level curve that passes through the point $(x,y)=(2,-2)$ can be found by computing $∇f(2,-2).$ \n\nSo, we first find the gradient and evaluate it at $(x,y)=(2,-2):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & ={f}_{x}(x,y)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y)\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x}))i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x}))j \\\\  & =\\frac{(-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}})}{1+{(\\frac{y}{x})}^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{(\\frac{1}{x})}{1+{(\\frac{y}{x})}^{2}}\\,j \\\\  & =-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,j \\\\ ∇f(2,-2) & =-\\frac{(-2)}{{2}^{2}+(-2)^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{2}{{2}^{2}+(-2)^{2}}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{8}\\,i+\\frac{2}{8}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(i+j)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we normalize $∇f(2,-2):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∇f(2,-2)}{‖∇f(2,-2)‖} & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}(i+j)}{‖\\frac{1}{4}(i+j)‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}})}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}(i+j) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(i+j) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}(i+j).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383168 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383169 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383170 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383171 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383172 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383170 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383167 1080 #uuid "20194f88-b71b-5ea3-a75b-4873d6a1dd62" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383168 1081 "i-j" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383168 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383168 1084 #uuid "ce66abc2-1493-50b5-a986-b312bd69b0d3" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383169 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}(-i+j)" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383169 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383169 1084 #uuid "97a0676c-47bb-533c-80d9-c0d75ef46077" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383170 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}(i+j)" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383170 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383170 1084 #uuid "83aa1130-305c-5cb1-a