ow,  so it does not change the determinant.\n\nTherefore, we only have to change the sign of the determinant to the opposite one. Consequently, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B) & =-det(A) \\\\  & =-(23) \\\\  & =-23.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383210 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383211 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383212 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383213 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383214 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383213 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383209 1080 #uuid "19c40756-1ae1-55ae-86e7-0dc818b95e09" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383210 1081 "20" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383210 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383210 1084 #uuid "d90fab71-15ff-5154-8626-0065130da4bf" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383211 1081 "26" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383211 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383211 1084 #uuid "d60ff1cc-e04c-5e97-b4d5-91717ba060d4" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383212 1081 "-30" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383212 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383212 1084 #uuid "7b55776f-fb40-547c-87b6-e49a33a6d01f" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383213 1081 "-23" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383213 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383213 1084 #uuid "e01c2414-82ca-5b80-9168-7660be02d0f1" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [175