$ is the scalar field given by\n\n$$\n∇\\cdot F=\\text{div}\\,F=\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\cdot F & =\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(y\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3{x}^{2}+3{y}^{2}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate $\\text{div}\\,F$ at the point $(3,4),$ and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(∇\\cdot F)(3,4) & =3\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{9+16} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{25} \\\\  & =15.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383259 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383260 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383261 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383262 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383263 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383262 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383258 1080 #uuid "4feb22a8-b9e6-59d8-a756-c12f2d26d5cd" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383259 1081 "12" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383259 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383259 1084 #uuid "86fc3b2f-e528-5aa6-b7af-f6ac8563fdab" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383260 1081 "10" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383260 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383260 1084 #uuid "e54145e9-4574-5349-ab5f-74b95bdfc80e" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [1759218638326