94139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383494 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383494 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383495 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383494 1080 #uuid "646a1a86-23fa-54d0-a9d3-a07a5a07f69f" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383495 1081 "\\frac{25}{3}" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383495 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383495 1084 #uuid "5b8a58d0-d24e-5374-9574-b1ac167e3e68" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383496 1081 "\\frac{14}{3}" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383496 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383496 1084 #uuid "a1bf687f-10f9-5412-96b2-c0bb67904953" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383497 1081 "\\frac{23}{6}" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383497 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383497 1084 #uuid "e4f970e3-1299-5474-a667-e3fb8bfdff41" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383498 1081 "\\frac{19}{3}" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383498 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383498 1084 #uuid "092af51a-8ad8-5776-9591-b1159c8cf01b" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383499 1081 "\\frac{29}{6}" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383499 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383499 1084 #uuid "5abcfbf6-76de-50f9-9a89-80041e3d5998" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383500 1068 #edb/ref 17592186383501 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383500 1069 "q-15229" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383500 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383500 1071 "At an archaeological site, an object is found with $70%$ of its original carbon-14 content. Given that the half-life of carbon-14 is $5\\,730$ years, approximately how old is the object?" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383500 1072 #uuid "60292909-ce24-593a-b903-368e85e24430" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383500 1074 "The mass $M(t)$ of a radioactive substance at time $t$ can be modeled by the differential equation\n\n$$\n{M}^{′}(t)=-kM(t),\\,M(0)={M}_{0}.\n$$\n\nThe general solution to this equation is\n\n$$\nM(t)={M}_{0}{e}^{-kt}.\n$$\n\nThe half-life ${t}_{1/2}$ is the time taken for the mass of the substance to reduce by one half and is given by\n\n$$\n{t}_{1/2}=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{k}.\n$$\n\nSince we know that ${t}_{1/2}=5\\,730$ years, we have\n\n$$\n5\\,730=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{k}\\,⇒\\,k=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{5\\,730}.\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\nM(t)={M}_{0}{e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/5\\,730}.\n$$\n\nWe wish to calculate the time $t$ such that $M(t)=0.7{M}_{0}.$ So, we set up our equation as follows:\n\n$$\n0.7{M}_{0}={M}_{0}{e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/5\\,730}\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.7{M}_{0} & ={M}_{0}{e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/5\\,730} \\\\ 0.7\\cancel{{M}_{0}} & =\\cancel{{M}_{0}}{e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/5\\,730} \\\\ 0.7 & ={e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/5\\,730} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(0.7) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/5\\,730}) \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(0.7) & =-\\frac{t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{5\\,730} \\\\ t & =-\\frac{5\\,730\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡(0.7)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\ t & ≈2\\,949\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the object is approximately $2\\,949$ years old." 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383502 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383503 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383504 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383505 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383506 13194139533455 1759218