5 true] [17592186383879 1074 "The principle of induction states the following: Suppose we have a sequence of mathematical statements $P(1),P(2),P(3),…,$ where\n\n- $P(1)$ is true, and\n\n- $P(k)⇒P(k+1)$ for every $k\\in N.$\n\nThen, $P(n)$ is true for every $n\\in N.$\n\nIn this case, the general statement $P(n)$ we're required to prove is the following:\n\n$P(n):\\,2\\,∣\\,{n}^{4}-{n}^{2}$ for all $n\\in N$\n\nWe start by proving the base case, $P(1).$ To do this, we substitute $n=1$ into the expression and show it is divisible by $2:$\n\nWe proceed using induction on $n.$\n\n**Base Case**: We first prove that our statement is true for the base case $n=1.$ Substituting $n=1$ into the expression ${n}^{4}-{n}^{2},$ we have\n\n$$\nP(1):\\,{1}^{4}-{1}^{2}=0,\\,\\text{and}\\,2\\,∣\\,0\n$$\n\nThus, our statement is true for $n=1.$\n\nNext, we state our inductive hypothesis. Here, we assume that the given statement is true for some $n=k\\ge 1.$\n\n**Inductive Hypothesis**: We assume that for some $n=k\\ge 1,$ we have that\n\n$$\nP(k):\\,2\\,∣\\,{k}^{4}-{k}^{2}.\n$$\n\nWe must show that $P(k)⇒P(k+1).$ Let's start by writing down $P(k+1).$ This is the first part of the **inductive step**.\n\n**Inductive Step**: We're required to prove that\n\n$$\nP(k+1):\\,2\\,∣\\,(k+1)^{4}-(k+1)^{2}.\\,\\,(∗)\n$$\n\nThe idea is to rewrite the expression $(k+1)^{4}-(k+1)^{2}$ as ${k}^{4}-{k}^{2}$ (from the inductive hypothesis) plus a multiple of $2.$ We do this as follows:\n\nWe write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(k+1)^{4}-(k+1)^{2} & ={k}^{4}+4{k}^{3}+6{k}^{2}+4k+1-{k}^{2}-2k-1 \\\\  & ={k}^{4}+4{k}^{3}+5{k}^{2}+2k \\\\  & =({k}^{4}-{k}^{2})+2(2{k}^{3}+3{k}^{2}+k).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $2\\,∣\\,({k}^{4}-{k}^{2})$ by the inductive hypothesis, and $2(2{k}^{3}+3{k}^{2}+k)$ is clearly divisible by $2,$ their sum is also divisible by $2,$ as required.\n\nSince we have shown that the expression in $(∗)$ is divisible by $2,$ our proof is complete. So, let's write down our conclusion.\n\nTherefore, by the principle of induction, $2\\,∣\\,{n}^{4}-{n}^{2}$ for all $n\\in N.$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383880 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383881 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383880 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383882 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383880 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383883 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383880 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383880 1077 "field-1" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383880 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383881 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383880 1080 #uuid "32210355-e9d8-5f1f-843d-7eb55521be5f" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383881 1081 "1" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383881 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383881 1084 #uuid "f4d50b25-3df4-5020-8ecf-3efe0e586db1" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383882 1081 "0" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383882 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383882 1084 #uuid "a3bc5dc5-5716-5d3a-ba2f-2055b9be526b" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383883 1081 "k" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383883 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383883 1084 #uuid "0c37bded-bdb9-5a8c-8823-862380749958" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383884 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383885 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383884 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383886 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383884 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383887 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383884 1075 #edb/ref 17592186383888 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383884 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383884 1077 "field-9" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383884 1079 #edb/ref 17592186383887 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186383884 1080