{1}↔{R}_{2}$ (switching the first and the second rows). What is the value of $det(B)?$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385428 1072 #uuid "4d2eb3a4-1529-5361-9598-a0c5afbbd3cf" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385428 1074 "Since swapping any two rows changes the sign of the determinant to the opposite sign, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B) & =-det(A) \\\\  & =-(6) \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385430 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385431 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385432 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385433 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385434 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1079 #edb/ref 17592186385434 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385429 1080 #uuid "0f94982c-4ec7-5423-86de-a88f18f95a14" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385430 1081 "6" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385430 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385430 1084 #uuid "c31511e8-82ea-5af0-a213-66dd9b336d00" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385431 1081 "\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385431 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385431 1084 #uuid "3d205cfc-0512-50c3-a95b-46b05574fdab" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385432 1081 "Undefined" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385432 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385432 1084 #uuid "2acaf9d0-8561-5813-ab9c-315f11aafdb3" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385433 1081 "0" 13194139533455 175921