}\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $c=-1.$ Substituting this into the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n-(2x+2)=-4\\,⟹\\,x=1.\n$$\n\nAnd substituting $c=-1$ into the second equation, we have \n\n$$\n-(2y+2)=0\\,⟹\\,y=-1.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=1$ and $y=-1$ into our function, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =(1)^{2}+2(1)+(-1)^{2}+2(-1) \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the tangent plane is perpendicular to the vector $v$ at $(1,-1,2).$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385600 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385601 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385602 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385603 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385604 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1079 #edb/ref 17592186385602 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385599 1080 #uuid "fc46821c-d90f-57c3-87fa-76db78d17b0e" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385600 1081 "$(1,1,6)$ only" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385600 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385600 1084 #uuid "22adf989-5e2a-597b-819b-21a19def1126" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385601 1081 "$(1,-1,2)$ and $(-1,1,2)$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385601 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385601 1084 #uuid "11941d78-3eb3-50c3-b666-e730845aaa3f" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385602 1081 "$(1,-1,2)$ only" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385602 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385602 1084 #uuid "aa179fe0-208b-5917-b108-3ef3511520db" 13194139533