nt II is true, $f$ is an injection.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385693 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385694 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385695 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385696 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385697 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1079 #edb/ref 17592186385693 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385692 1080 #uuid "df761ac9-90f4-5c6f-ba68-ad1faf9f4e22" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385693 1081 "I, II, and III" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385693 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385693 1084 #uuid "e0c3f959-5171-59ff-838d-51e3fe713293" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385694 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385694 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385694 1084 #uuid "a30df9d4-c782-52c3-84d6-c86e15e7d455" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385695 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385695 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385695 1084 #uuid "04338b5f-5888-5616-8ee6-13a24f4daad1" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385696 1081 "I only" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385696 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385696 1084 #uuid "430f4a78-64b1-52ba-a7c6-ccdf11ed801d" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385697 1081 "II only" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385697 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 