 Statement III is true. Indeed, since statement II is true, $f$ is an injection.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385735 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385736 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385737 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385738 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385739 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1079 #edb/ref 17592186385736 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385734 1080 #uuid "e26db430-4903-5213-a3cd-614fd0d112cd" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385735 1081 "None of the statements are true" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385735 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385735 1084 #uuid "0e2e3bd4-c605-5900-89a7-c42b04f70825" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385736 1081 "I, II, and III" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385736 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385736 1084 #uuid "65ba502e-895c-5928-81f8-eda852b62fdb" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385737 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385737 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385737 1084 #uuid "94735337-c07e-5e57-a4ea-21e21bec7fc2" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385738 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385738 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385738 1084 #uuid "39c845c9-a1cc-5970-ac2c-329b8395e9c3" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385739 1081 "I only" 131941395334