& \\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =2v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2u & -2v \\\\ 2u & 2v\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2u\\cdot 2v-(-2v)\\cdot 2u \\\\  & =4uv+4uv \\\\  & =8uv.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385763 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385764 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385765 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385766 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385767 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1077 "selection" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1079 #edb/ref 17592186385765 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385762 1080 #uuid "38071234-9bc0-5b00-b590-cccd8d7c31d8" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385763 1081 "2({u}^{2}-{v}^{2})" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385763 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385763 1084 #uuid "564d868a-9fde-5394-a0a7-ee34c0c4d724" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385764 1081 "{u}^{2}-uv+{v}^{2}" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385764 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385764 1084 #uuid "a85952d3-86d1-5ecc-ad78-7dcdecf1e567" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385765 1081 "8uv" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385765 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385765 1084 #uuid "ff785874-5a5d-5b25-b151-f49876d09835" 13194139533455 17592186045585 true] [17592186385766 1081 "4(u-v)" 13194139533455 17592186045585